[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2101.19, "timestamp": "00:35:01", "text": "这篇文章中得到署名，是的，主要是在我的网站上。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2105.75, "timestamp": "00:35:05", "text": "嗯，我的网站，也就是我的主页 next.space，他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2109.43, "timestamp": "00:35:09", "text": "仍然会在那里署名。 嗯，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2112.63, "timestamp": "00:35:12", "text": "计划在未来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2117.99, "timestamp": "00:35:17", "text": "发布"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2123.43, "timestamp": "00:35:23", "text": "我的新模型等等之后，进行某种形式的拆分或其他操作。 所以，这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2126.71, "timestamp": "00:35:26", "text": "更像是一种分离，一方是那些曾经参与"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2129.75, "timestamp": "00:35:29", "text": "其中并"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2132.39, "timestamp": "00:35:32", "text": "为最初的系列作品创作了资产和衍生作品的人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2135.67, "timestamp": "00:35:35", "text": "最初的系列算是比较老的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2138.15, "timestamp": "00:35:38", "text": "型号，而这款也是目前最新的运动"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2140.79, "timestamp": "00:35:40", "text": "护裆设计。 这也是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2143.67, "timestamp": "00:35:43", "text": "初始系列的一部分，呃，那些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2145.43, "timestamp": "00:35:45", "text": "人将会在那里获得署名，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2148.069, "timestamp": "00:35:48", "text": "从那以后，新的运动型模特，那些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2149.91, "timestamp": "00:35:49", "text": "制作粉丝艺术作品的人，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2153.27, "timestamp": "00:35:53", "text": "这些粉丝艺术作品等等，都会被"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2155.91, "timestamp": "00:35:55", "text": "发布，所有新篇章的贡献者都会单独获得署名"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2158.95, "timestamp": "00:35:58", "text": "。 所以我就像是"}]